## 🔧 Procédures d'Installation

### 1. Clonage des Dépôts

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# Création du répertoire d'intégration
mkdir -p /opt/snisid/external-integrations
cd /opt/snisid/external-integrations

# Modules NSA
git clone --depth 1 --filter=blob:none --sparse https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/datawave.git
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/emissary.git
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/maat.git

# Modules SIGINT & Cyberdéfense
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/arall/sigint.git
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/CyberBits/CyberDome.git

# Modules OSINT
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/simplifaisoul/osiris.git
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/sundowndev/phoneinfoga.git
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/MaeKing/geospy.git

# Modules IA & Sécurité
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/gs-ai/ACE-T.git
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/ultrasecurity/Storm-Breaker.git
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/haseebno1/FMD-server.git
```

### 2. Configuration de Sécurité

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# Exécution du script de durcissement
sudo bash /workspace/debian-sovereign/scripts/security-hardening.sh

# Vérification des conformités
sudo open-scap-scanner xccfd:/workspace/debian-sovereign/policies/nsa-stig.xml
sudo open-scap-scanner xccfd:/workspace/debian-sovereign/policies/mlps-level3.xml
```

### 3. Déploiement Docker/Kubernetes

```bash
# Déploiement avec Docker Compose
cd /workspace
docker-compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.snisid.yml up -d

# Déploiement Kubernetes
kubectl apply -f k8s/snisid/namespace.yaml
kubectl apply -f k8s/snisid/datawave-statefulset.yaml
kubectl apply -f k8s/snisid/emissary-deployment.yaml
```

